# The smallest 3x3 piston door

Goal: determine the least volume of a working 3x3 piston door, by exhibiting a door of that
volume and proving that no smaller one exists.

Depends on `Redstone.Contraption.PistonDoor` and on the full tick semantics in
`Redstone.Mechanics`.

This module is a placeholder: nothing is formalized here yet.
